I always liked being a nalfeshnee (hope this is spelled right).
A middle (or is it high) level demon which can wear your armor and
wield weapons. So when you get polymorphed into one your cloaks or mails
won't tear apart. Besides there is a chance that you "gate" in some
fellow demons from hell when you are attacked.
So watch out for the message : "Some hell-p has arrived."

While talking about polymorphing :
It seems to me that the dev team changed it a bit (concerning the time that
you stay polymorphed) in NH31. I was polymorphed into a dragon (green as
far as i can recall) and stayed that way for at least 2000 moves (until I
was hit by death ray). You sure couldn't do this in NH30j.


